{{!
    @template local_embedpoll/options_editor_line

    One line of the poll form's options: a handle to drag it by, the option, and a button to
    delete it.

    The line has no name and no number. local_embedpoll/options_editor numbers every line, and
    renumbers them whenever they change, so the labels that hold a number are left empty here.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * label - The option, or nothing for a new line

    Example context (json):
    {
        "label": "Yes"
    }
}}
<div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-2" data-region="local_embedpoll-option">
    <span class="local-embedpoll-draghandle mr-2">{{> core/drag_handle }}</span>
    <input type="text" class="form-control flex-grow-1" value="{{label}}" data-region="local_embedpoll-optionlabel">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-icon ml-1" data-action="local_embedpoll-deleteoption">
        {{#pix}} t/delete, core {{/pix}}
    </button>
</div>
